flowchart LR
    H[Human Intent and Approvals]
    UX[Question Flow UI / Graph Canvas / Dashboard]
    DP[Definition Plane\nProblem, Scope, ADRs, Contracts, Diagrams]
    G[(System Graph / Digital Twin)]
    GE[Gate Evaluator\nDoR / DoD / Release / Operate]
    EO[Ecosystem Orchestrator]
    SO[System Orchestrators]
    CO[Component Orchestrators]
    WR[(Work Order Queue)]
    BR[Builder Agents]
    VR[Verifier Agents]
    SR[Security / Performance / Compliance Reviewers]
    DR[Docs / Release Agents]
    EV[(Evidence Plane\nCI, Tests, Telemetry, Incidents)]
    LP[Learning Plane\nGuardrail Packs / Error Patterns / Standards Updates]
    RT[Runtime Systems]

    H --> UX
    UX --> DP
    DP --> G
    G --> GE
    GE --> UX
    G --> EO
    EO --> SO
    SO --> CO
    CO --> WR
    WR --> BR
    WR --> VR
    WR --> SR
    WR --> DR
    BR --> EV
    VR --> EV
    SR --> EV
    DR --> EV
    EV --> G
    RT --> EV
    EV --> LP
    LP --> G
    LP --> EO
    H --> EO
    EO --> H
